    <h1>Jamie West</h1>
    <h2>Secure &ne; Slow.</h2>
    <p>
        <span class="main-tagline">Hello! I’m Jamie, a security-focused Cloud Engineering and DevOps professional.</span>
        <span class="intro-text">We all get our kicks somewhere; for me, it's helping high-performing organisations remain secure without sacrificing velocity. If this aligns with your goals, please get in touch:</span>
    </p>

    <nav class="links" aria-label="Navigation and Profiles">
        <a href="/blog/">Blog</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/Jamian/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer me" aria-label="GitHub Profile">GitHub</a>
        <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jamieianwest/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer me" aria-label="LinkedIn Profile">LinkedIn</a>
        <a href="mailto:hello@jamieianwest.com" aria-label="Send Email">Email</a>
    </nav>

